  "solution": {
    "brief": "Wasp example 23: new topic series",
    "principle": "\n\nRelated insight: \n\nRelated insight: Tutorial 24 (wasp_24) directly continues the new topic series from tutorial 23, further developing attribute-driven, graph-mapper, and field-driven discrete aggregation with multi-part and constraint-based workflows. Tutorial 23 is a direct prerequisite for tutorial 24, and the two share closely related content around part-based, rule-based, and attribute-based aggregation strategies.\n\nRelated insight: \n\nRelated insight: Tutorial 25 (wasp_25) further continues the new topic series beyond tutorial 24, confirming the series extends to at least tutorial 25 and introduces iso-curve and gradient-visualization as new focal techniques.\n\nRelated insight: Tutorial 26 (wasp_26) further continues the new topic series beyond tutorial 25, confirming the series extends through at least tutorial 26. The series now incorporates contour-field techniques alongside the established iso-curve, gradient-visualization, attribute-driven, and field-driven aggregation workflows.",
